        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kawakwakuhemba kuyisu; anyana kaShalumi, anyana kaAteri, anyana kaTalimoni, anyana kaAkubi, anyana kaHatita, anyana kaShobayi, kuyibomba wejima wawu nkulakaji namakumi asatu nawantu atanu nawana.",
