              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu afumini kuTelimela, nakuTeliharisha, nakuKerubi, nakuAdani, nakuImeri, hiyatwesheli kushimuna mavumu awankakulula jawu hela kwasemukawu, hela nawu, TuyaIsarelaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
