            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulumpi amakwawu akumavumu awankakulula jawu, chashikiluwu kwitala daYehova dekala muYerusalema, hiyakulambula chamunyichima yawu yetala daNzambi yakudituŋa nachu muchipela chadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.68",
