            "number": "69",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 2:69"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "69",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuhana mwesekela Ŋovu jawu, jidariki jawuru makombakaji makumi atanu nadimu nekombakaji dimu, jipawundi jasiliva makombakaji atanu, yi kovwelu yakuvwala atupristu nkulakaji, hiyakusha mwaswekelaŋawu yuma yamudimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.2.69",
